# Data Structures

## Sutra Data Structure

### File Location
[src/data/sutras.js](mdc:src/data/sutras.js)

### Sutra Entry Schema

```javascript
{
  id: 'xin-jing',              // Unique identifier (kebab-case)
  title: '心经',                // Short title (displayed in bookshelf)
  fullName: '《般若波罗蜜多心经》', // Full title with book name
  translator: '唐三藏法师玄奘译',   // Translator/author
  cover: '📖',                  // Emoji or image path
  description: '般若经类中最短的一部，阐述般若思想的精髓。', // Brief description
  
  // Chapters/Sections
  chapters: [
    {
      id: 'full-text',         // Chapter ID
      title: '全文',            // Chapter title
      content: '观自在菩萨，行深般若波罗蜜多时，照见五蕴皆空，度一切苦厄...', // Full scripture text
      wordCount: 260            // Word count (optional)
    }
  ],
  
  // Metadata
  wordCount: 260,              // Total word count
  category: '般若部',           // Category (optional)
  tags: ['般若', '心经'],       // Tags for search/filtering (optional)
  difficulty: 'beginner'       // Difficulty level (optional)
}
```

### MVP Scriptures (3-5 Classics)

1. **心经** (xin-jing)
   - Title: 《般若波罗蜜多心经》
   - Translator: 唐三藏法师玄奘译
   - Word Count: 260

2. **金刚经** (jin-gang-jing)
   - Title: 《金刚般若波罗蜜经》
   - Translator: 姚秦三藏法师鸠摩罗什译
   - Word Count: ~5,200

3. **大势至菩萨念佛圆通章** (da-shi-zhi)
   - Title: 《大势至菩萨念佛圆通章》
   - Translator: 唐般刺密谛译
   - Word Count: ~240

4. **普门品** (pu-men-pin)
   - Title: 《观世音菩萨普门品》
   - Translator: 姚秦三藏法师鸠摩罗什译
   - Word Count: ~2,500

5. **佛说阿弥陀经** (a-mi-tuo)
   - Title: 《佛说阿弥陀经》
   - Translator: 姚秦三藏法师鸠摩罗什译
   - Word Count: ~1,800

### Usage Example

```javascript
// Import sutras
import sutras from '@/data/sutras.js'

// Get all sutras for bookshelf
const allSutras = sutras

// Find sutra by ID
const sutra = sutras.find(s => s.id === 'xin-jing')

// Get chapter content
const chapterContent = sutra.chapters[0].content
```

